<div class="case-card">
<div class="case-kicker">
<p>THE ORDINARY MOMENT</p>
</div>
<div class="case-headline">
<p>A SoCO discussion becomes a perspective piece.</p>
</div>
<div class="case-copy">
<p>The scientific conversation feels collective. But once there is a manuscript, the byline forces practical decisions: who should be invited, what contribution is expected, and when do we revisit the author group?</p>
</div>
</div>
