<div class="question-kicker">
<p>THE WORKSHOP QUESTION</p>
</div>
<div class="question-big">
<p>Not only who qualifies.</p>
</div>
<div class="question-small">
<p>How should we decide — early enough, explicitly enough, transparently enough, and flexibly enough — as the work evolves?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="slide-thesis fragment fade-in" data-fragment-index="1">
<p>The goal is not to replace authorship criteria. It is to make the decision process visible.</p>
</div>
