<aside class="notes"><p>When a discussion becomes a manuscript, a process that felt informal becomes much more concrete. Someone has to decide who will be invited and what each person will do.</p><p>That is why the question is broader than who qualifies at the end. How should the collaboration create opportunities, communicate expectations, and revisit decisions?</p><p>That is the practical conversation I hope we can make more visible.</p></aside>

